<title>USA: Scarsdale, N.Y., won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Scarsdale, N.Y., won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc., said it won $1.370</p>
<p>million of Scarsdale, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1996,</p>
<p>with a net interest cost of 4.97 percent.</p>
</text>
